Right? It was better than Commando.

00:34:13.940 --> 00:34:16.800
Sure. I think we said that a little, some, for some reason.

00:34:18.220 --> 00:34:24.580
Wow. This game is like, uh, both games now to me are just like, oh, trash these NES games.

00:34:24.900 --> 00:34:28.460
I'll say, I remember, I remember liking it a lot when we first played it, when it was

00:34:28.460 --> 00:34:32.280
early. And when I went back the other day, when I was playing this, I went back and played the original.

00:34:33.080 --> 00:34:34.820
