00:34:39.640 --> 00:34:41.660
my overall list of games we've played.

00:34:41.980 --> 00:34:45.900
But I do think it is head and shoulders better than Ikari Warriors 2.

00:34:46.120 --> 00:34:47.060
I don't know if you guys agree.

00:34:47.160 --> 00:34:50.420
Oh, I agree. I can, I can still at least enjoy that game.

00:34:50.840 --> 00:34:55.080
Ikari Warriors 2 is just a step in the wrong direction in so many ways too.

00:34:55.080 --> 00:34:59.140
