00:35:29.920 --> 00:35:34.280
And this feels like it's trying to do this weird like, Legend of Zelda thing where you're

00:35:34.280 --> 00:35:36.040
like, go into a dungeon and you're like, I don't know.

00:35:36.040 --> 00:35:38.960
