This is a Micronics game.

00:50:17.280 --> 00:50:19.520
Oh, no. The same people that brought us.

00:50:19.920 --> 00:50:22.000
1942. Ikari Warriors 1.

00:50:22.000 --> 00:50:23.120
Athena.

00:50:24.020 --> 00:50:25.000
Elevator Action.

00:50:26.500 --> 00:50:27.820
