00:50:28.260 --> 00:50:29.120
Oh, Tiger Heli.

00:50:29.380 --> 00:50:30.260
That one was okay.

00:50:30.600 --> 00:50:31.400
Not great.

00:50:31.560 --> 00:50:32.980
I kind of remember enjoying that.

00:50:33.220 --> 00:50:34.600
Ghosts and Goblins. Okay.

