Yeah. And Super Pitfall.

00:50:38.360 --> 00:50:43.780
One of the worst NES games we've ever played where you're so delicate that you can't even,

00:50:43.780 --> 00:50:45.280
like, jump and jump.

00:50:45.280 --> 00:50:47.700
Yeah. So, yeah.

00:50:47.800 --> 00:50:49.840
Micronics not really bringing it home.

00:50:50.180 --> 00:50:56.480
And SNK, who's the publisher and the developer of the arcade version of the game, really letting

00:50:56.480 --> 00:51:01.780
the ball drop here on, like, continuing to trust Micronics.

00:51:01.780 --> 00:51:10.940
This is a problem that developers even today still commit the sin of, like, trusting their

00:51:10.940 --> 00:51:13.780
ports to subpar companies.

00:51:13.980 --> 00:51:19.180
But to do it over and over, like this company, is insane.

00:51:19.460 --> 00:51:25.480
Unless I'm mistaken, the next time we see SNK will be for Iron Tank, the Invasion of Normandy.

00:51:25.740 --> 00:51:28.260
Wow. And that's episode 109.

00:51:28.740 --> 00:51:31.000
