They should stay there. And then real fast, I'm going to show these guys the arcade intro, because it's a little more involved than the intro for the NES game.

00:53:49.300 --> 00:53:54.440
But then I'll play the audio from it, because this is a really ridiculous start to a game.

00:53:54.620 --> 00:54:03.340
And I think, like, if anybody ever wanted to be intimidated by a boss that doesn't wind up being the actual final boss, that guy we were talking about,

